/pingcap/","score":2,"flags":0,"comment_count":0,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"yashgarg","user_is_author":false,"tags":["databases"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/lm7d2z","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/lm7d2z/pingcap_tidb_cloud_leaks"},{"short_id":"73ozwc","created_at":"2026-10-20T20:01:13.638-05:00","title":"Lobsters NYC Meetup on the 28th of October","url":"","score":32,"flags":0,"comment_count":5,"description":"\u003cp\u003eI previously arranged (by PMing everyone who mentioned it) a 5 Lobster meetup in Mexico. I'll be in NYC next week and think this could be nice. There will be cross contamination from Array Language people.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe can target e.g. 5:30PM until ???, perhaps by Bryant Park or Borough Hall. (I don't know the general city well, mostly commuting to friends near Myrtle or in Manhattan on quick trips, but these seem like generally accessibly locations). As a first pass, I suggest Maman Cafe, but hope someone recommends something better.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePM me for my contact information if you want, or to hang out at another time. :)\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"I previously arranged (by PMing everyone who mentioned it) a 5 Lobster meetup in Mexico. I'll be in NYC next week and think this could be nice. There will be cross contamination from Array Language people.\r\n\r\nWe can target e.g. 5:30PM until ???, perhaps by Bryant Park or Borough Hall. (I don't know the general city well, mostly commuting to friends near Myrtle or in Manhattan on quick trips, but these seem like generally accessibly locations). As a first pass, I suggest Maman Cafe, but hope someone recommends something better.\r\n\r\nPM me for my contact information if you want, or to hang out at another time. :)","submitter_user":"veqq","user_is_author":true,"tags":["event"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/73ozwc","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/73ozwc/lobsters_nyc_meetup_on_28th_october"},{"short_id"